| `make test-fe` `[local]` | Runs every frontend test suite: `make test-fe-unit`, then `make test-fe-e2e`. It is a `make verify` goal of its own, and `make test` does not reach it. | `make test-fe` | [`FE_APPS`](settings.md#make-variables) | The same exit 2 as its two suites, from the first; no skip. Its test counts are not in the evidence record: only pytest's are. CI runs it after `make fe-install` and `make fe-browsers`. | [dev-loops.md](../guides/dev-loops.md) | always |
